{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/202687ZZM7P00U1789030509.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p style=\"text-align: left;\">一帶一路高峰論壇，連續第二天在灣仔會展舉行。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">早上有多場對話環節，出席的包括來自巴基斯坦與卡塔爾的財金官員。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.BELT-1130_001.jpg\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/2026SRhjuUIvHp1789017695.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_J.BELT-1130_001.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">國際調解院秘書長鄭若驊致辭時指，調解院的簽署國已增至47個，包括16個締約國，全部是「一帶一路」的成員。她指調解院可以成為「一帶一路」合作的潤滑劑，鼓勵各參與者將調解機制，納入政策與商業策略中。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-10T09:00:03.433157+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":152,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}